    "section_accordions_CjqwhE": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_UxBRTn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Wrinkle Reduction",
            "text": "<p>A study with 114 women aged 45–65 showed that after 8 weeks of daily <strong>Verisol®</strong> supplementation, <strong>wrinkle volume decreased</strong> significantly. Participants also reported smoother, firmer skin.</p><p><a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s13555-024-01184-2#:~:text=In%20a%20double%2Dblind%2C%20placebo,weeks%20of%20intake%2C%20with%20a\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s13555-024-01184-2#:~:text=In%20a%20double%2Dblind%2C%20placebo,weeks%20of%20intake%2C%20with%20a\">View Clinical Study (1)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2021-03/VERISOL%20Beauty%20from%20within%202020%20%20%28WEB%29.pdf#:~:text=The%20study%20revealed%20that%20supplementation%20with%20VERISOL%C2%AE,over%20the%20course%20of%20the%20washout%20period.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2021-03/VERISOL%20Beauty%20from%20within%202020%20%20%28WEB%29.pdf#:~:text=The%20study%20revealed%20that%20supplementation%20with%20VERISOL%C2%AE,over%20the%20course%20of%20the%20washout%20period.\">View Clinical Study (2)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.rachelstaggsaesthetics.co.uk/media/ky2huguo/collegen-verisol.pdf#:~:text=After%208%20weeks%20the%20wrinkle%20volume%20of,helped%20to%20improve%20the%20appearance%20of%20wrinkles.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.rachelstaggsaesthetics.co.uk/media/ky2huguo/collegen-verisol.pdf#:~:text=After%208%20weeks%20the%20wrinkle%20volume%20of,helped%20to%20improve%20the%20appearance%20of%20wrinkles.\">View Clinical Study (3)</a><br/><a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s13555-024-01184-2#:~:text=In%20a%20double%2Dblind%2C%20placebo,weeks%20of%20intake%2C%20with%20a\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s13555-024-01184-2#:~:text=In%20a%20double%2Dblind%2C%20placebo,weeks%20of%20intake%2C%20with%20a\">View Clinical Study (4)</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_pnFxGc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Skin Elasticity",
            "text": "<p>A placebo-controlled trial with 69 women aged 35–55 found that daily supplementation with <strong>Verisol®</strong> improved skin elasticity by <strong>15%</strong> within just <strong>4 weeks</strong>.</p><p><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23949208/#:~:text=In%20this%20double%2Dblind%2C%20placebo%2Dcontrolled%20trial%2C%2069%20women,subjects%20being%20allocated%20to%20each%20treatment%20group.&text=After%204%20weeks%20of%20follow%2Dup%20treatment%2C%20a,elasticity%20level%20was%20determined%20in%20elderly%20women.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23949208/#:~:text=In%20this%20double%2Dblind%2C%20placebo%2Dcontrolled%20trial%2C%2069%20women,subjects%20being%20allocated%20to%20each%20treatment%20group.&text=After%204%20weeks%20of%20follow%2Dup%20treatment%2C%20a,elasticity%20level%20was%20determined%20in%20elderly%20women.\">View Clinical Study (1)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.blueiron.fi/data/pam/public/attachements/verisol%C2%AE_studies.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.blueiron.fi/data/pam/public/attachements/verisol%C2%AE_studies.pdf\">View Clinical Study (2)</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_3BkUjE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cellulite Reduction",
            "text": "<p>A clinical trial in women aged 50–70 demonstrated that fish-derived that <strong>Verisol® F</strong> reduced cellulite appearance and improved skin elasticity within <strong>4 to 8 weeks</strong>.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.nmi.health/collagen-a-review-of-clinical-use-and-efficacy/#:~:text=the%20gut%20microbiota.-,Cellulite,improvement%20with%20longer%20therapy%20duration.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.nmi.health/collagen-a-review-of-clinical-use-and-efficacy/#:~:text=the%20gut%20microbiota.-,Cellulite,improvement%20with%20longer%20therapy%20duration.\">View Clinical Study (1)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.blueiron.fi/data/pam/public/attachements/verisol%C2%AE_studies.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.blueiron.fi/data/pam/public/attachements/verisol%C2%AE_studies.pdf\">View Clinical Study (2)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/blog/amazingcollagen/verisolr-f-fishing-best-results#:~:text=And%20now%2C%20a%20new%20study,Collagen%20Peptides%2C%20contact%20us%20today.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/blog/amazingcollagen/verisolr-f-fishing-best-results#:~:text=And%20now%2C%20a%20new%20study,Collagen%20Peptides%2C%20contact%20us%20today.\">View Clinical Study (3)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2021-03/VERISOL%20Beauty%20from%20within%202020%20%20%28WEB%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2021-03/VERISOL%20Beauty%20from%20within%202020%20%20%28WEB%29.pdf\">View Clinical Study (4)</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_3WVqT8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Nail Health",
            "text": "<p>In a study of 25 participants, daily <strong>Verisol®</strong> use led to faster nail growth and a <strong>42%</strong> reduction in cracked or chipped nails after 6 months.</p><p><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28786550/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28786550/\">View Clinical Study (1)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2021-03/VERISOL%20Beauty%20from%20within%202020%20%20%28WEB%29.pdf#:~:text=The%20study%20revealed%20that%20supplementation%20with%20VERISOL%C2%AE,over%20the%20course%20of%20the%20washout%20period.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2021-03/VERISOL%20Beauty%20from%20within%202020%20%20%28WEB%29.pdf#:~:text=The%20study%20revealed%20that%20supplementation%20with%20VERISOL%C2%AE,over%20the%20course%20of%20the%20washout%20period.\">View Clinical Study (2)</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_njzBRM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Hair Thickness",
            "text": "<p>A 16-week trial with 44 women aged 39–75 revealed increased hair thickness and strength. The results were attributed to improved hair follicle activity and collagen matrix support.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/study-increasedhairthickness#:~:text=New%20randomized%2C%20placebo%2Dcontrolled%20study%20shows%20that%20supplementation,and%20proliferation%20of%20human%20hair%20follicle%20cells.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/study-increasedhairthickness#:~:text=New%20randomized%2C%20placebo%2Dcontrolled%20study%20shows%20that%20supplementation,and%20proliferation%20of%20human%20hair%20follicle%20cells.\">View Clinical Study (1)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2020-04/Positiv%20effect%20VEISOL%20on%20hair%20PR.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/sites/default/files/documents/2020-04/Positiv%20effect%20VEISOL%20on%20hair%20PR.pdf\">View Clinical Study (2)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.nutritioninsight.com/news/gelitas-bioactive-collagen-peptides-boosts-hair-thickness-new-study-finds.html\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.nutritioninsight.com/news/gelitas-bioactive-collagen-peptides-boosts-hair-thickness-new-study-finds.html\">View Clinical Study (3)</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_xEjyMN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Bone Health",
            "text": "<p>A study involving 131 postmenopausal women found that daily <strong>Verisol®</strong> supplementation increased bone mineral density (BMD) after 12 months.</p><p><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5793325/#:~:text=5.,age%2Drelated%20decline%20in%20BMD.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5793325/#:~:text=5.,age%2Drelated%20decline%20in%20BMD.\">View Clinical Study (1)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/applications/health-nutrition/bone-health#:~:text=Collagen%20isn't%20just%20an,%2Ddrink%20concentrates%2C%20sports%20drinks.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/applications/health-nutrition/bone-health#:~:text=Collagen%20isn't%20just%20an,%2Ddrink%20concentrates%2C%20sports%20drinks.\">View Clinical Study (2)</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/blog/amazingcollagen/collagen-peptides-missing-link-bone-health#:~:text=Additionally%2C%20changes%20in%20bone%20turnover%20markers%20were,interactions%20with%20other%20medications%20or%20tolerability%20issues.\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.gelita.com/en/blog/amazingcollagen/collagen-peptides-missing-link-bone-health#:~:text=Additionally%2C%20changes%20in%20bone%20turnover%20markers%20were,interactions%20with%20other%20medications%20or%20tolerability%20issues.\">View Clinical Study (3)</a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
