        },
        "text_nq9wVB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vitamin C plays a crucial role in <strong>collagen synthesis</strong>, making it an important nutrient to pair with collagen supplements for <strong>skin, joint, and overall health benefits</strong>. As a powerful antioxidant, vitamin C neutralises <strong>free radicals</strong> that degrade collagen (e.g., from UV exposure, pollution, and ageing).</p>",
